      "html": "<div id=\"step-q26811\" class=\"step questionWidget\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 1</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>Which of the following is the graph of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"4\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>?</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div><table class=\"questionWidget-choicesTable\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-26811-a\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">a</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-26811-a-4\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-26811-b\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">b</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-26811-a-5\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-26811-c\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">c</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-26811-a-3\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-26811-d\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\" style=\"background: rgb(64, 64, 64); color: white;\">d</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-26811-a-1\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetter\"><div id=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-26811-e\" class=\"questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle\">e</div></td><td class=\"questionWidget-choiceText\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-26811-a-2\"></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>First, we plot the graph of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"2\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"4\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>:</mo></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<div id=\"graphic-q-26811-e-0\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/q-26811-e-0\"></div>\n\n<p>To sketch the graph of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"3\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"4\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> we take the graph of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"4\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup space=\"4\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and shift it <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"5\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> units up. The <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"6\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>-intercept moves from <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"7\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998